# github-actions-conclusion-audit's own documented run-history collection directory
# (SKILL.md's "Collect run JSON" recipe) -- deliberately repo-relative rather than the
# session scratchpad, since exports are meant to persist across collection runs for
# volatility comparison, not be discarded after one use. Gitignored here to close the
# gap between that skill's own stated mitigation ("recommend gitignoring it") and this
# repo's actual .gitignore, per PR #355 round-3 review.
artifacts/

